<section class="border-y-2 border-ink bg-accent py-24 sm:py-32 cv-auto" id="process">
  <div class="section-shell">
    <div class="grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_.7fr] lg:items-end">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow !text-ink/60">03 — Process</p>
        <h2 class="display mt-3 text-4xl font-bold sm:text-6xl text-ink">A clear path from ambiguity to a reliable product.</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink/75 font-medium">Services describe what I deliver. This process shows how I reduce risk, keep communication clear, and move the work forward.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="relative mt-16 grid gap-5 lg:grid-cols-4">
      <div class="absolute left-0 right-0 top-10 hidden h-0.5 bg-ink/25 lg:block"></div>
      <article class="process-card relative rounded-3xl border-2 border-ink bg-paper p-7 shadow-[7px_7px_0_#151310]">
        <span class="display relative z-10 grid h-20 w-20 place-items-center rounded-full border-2 border-ink bg-accent text-3xl font-bold text-white">01</span>
        <p class="mt-9 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[.2em] text-ink/45">Understand first</p>
        <h3 class="display mt-3 text-3xl font-bold">Discover</h3>
        <p class="mt-4 text-ink/65">Clarify business goals, user needs, constraints, existing workflows, and measurable outcomes.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="process-card relative rounded-3xl border-2 border-ink bg-paper p-7 shadow-[7px_7px_0_#151310]">
        <span class="display relative z-10 grid h-20 w-20 place-items-center rounded-full border-2 border-ink bg-accent text-3xl font-bold text-white">02</span>
        <p class="mt-9 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[.2em] text-ink/45">Design the system</p>
        <h3 class="display mt-3 text-3xl font-bold">Architect</h3>
        <p class="mt-4 text-ink/65">Define priorities, data flow, modules, technical decisions, milestones, and delivery boundaries.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="process-card relative rounded-3xl border-2 border-ink bg-paper p-7 shadow-[7px_7px_0_#151310]">
        <span class="display relative z-10 grid h-20 w-20 place-items-center rounded-full border-2 border-ink bg-accent text-3xl font-bold text-white">03</span>
        <p class="mt-9 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[.2em] text-ink/45">Iterate visibly</p>
        <h3 class="display mt-3 text-3xl font-bold">Build &amp; Validate</h3>
        <p class="mt-4 text-ink/65">Develop in focused increments, test critical flows, review progress, and incorporate practical feedback.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="process-card relative rounded-3xl border-2 border-ink bg-paper p-7 shadow-[7px_7px_0_#151310]">
        <span class="display relative z-10 grid h-20 w-20 place-items-center rounded-full border-2 border-ink bg-accent text-3xl font-bold text-white">04</span>
        <p class="mt-9 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[.2em] text-ink/45">Operate with confidence</p>
        <h3 class="display mt-3 text-3xl font-bold">Launch &amp; Improve</h3>
        <p class="mt-4 text-ink/65">Deploy safely, monitor usage and performance, document the system, and continue improving it.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
